                                                "sense_id": "33533c8c-677f-365f-b4c4-8208eccbc123",
                                                "text": "Addressing a short pass from Henderson, he always felt too smart for Mykola Matviyenko, taking a step to lure him one way; dropping his shoulder and skating in the other direction, further inside."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
